    "title": "Former St. Johns County fire chief wins lawsuit, claims breach of contract - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago ST. JOHNS COUNTY, Fla. — A former fire chief in St. Johns County has won a lawsuit against the county, where he alleges his contract was breached. Scott Bullard submitted his resignation letter on Oct. 4, 2023, where he says his resignation was \"recommended by the county administration.\" He was also unable to return to his previous position. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
